// EXPECT:   +30   n=3 mean=20.00 min=10 max=30
// EXPECT:   +40   n=4 mean=25.00 min=10 max=40
// EXPECT:     (dropped 10)
// EXPECT:   +55   n=4 mean=36.25 min=20 max=55
// EXPECT:     (dropped 20)
// EXPECT:   +15   n=4 mean=35.00 min=15 max=55
// EXPECT:     (dropped 30)
// EXPECT:   +60   n=4 mean=42.50 min=15 max=60
// EXPECT:     (dropped 40)
// EXPECT:   +5    n=4 mean=33.75 min=5 max=60
// EXPECT:     (dropped 55)
// EXPECT:   +25   n=4 mean=26.25 min=5 max=60
